        "char_end": 336,
        "char_start": 276,
        "episode_id": "ep-de59d003651d9e5d",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "People think racing is about nerve. You say it's about risk.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:sophie-laurent",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Sophie Laurent"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:c689c41c5bef3446",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 560,
        "char_start": 353,
        "episode_id": "ep-de59d003651d9e5d",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "It's risk management, honestly. The crash that ends your season is almost never the scary-looking one \u2014 it's the boring risk you didn't name. Name the risk before it names you, and half the danger goes away.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:a319096bc89d13cb",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 777,
        "char_start": 560,
        "episode_id": "ep-de59d003651d9e5d",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "And you have to ride the whole run as a system, not a list of corners. The mistakes come from how one section sets up the next. When I logged a full season of my own crashes, the causes were always two turns upstream.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:1f8545152b0daba1",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 860,
        "char_start": 784,
        "episode_id": "ep-de59d003651d9e5d",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "That's almost word-for-word what a friend in finance says about a portfolio.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:a3734211bf939977",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1066,
        "char_start": 877,
        "episode_id": "ep-de59d003651d9e5d",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "It's the same discipline. A race line and a portfolio are both systems of correlated bets \u2014 you're managing the interactions, and the risk you can describe is the one you can design around.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 48000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 42000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p01_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
